# /dev repair, part 1 -- CREATE ONLY.  Removes nothing.
# Generated from tools/proto-dev-ipnx780.
#
# It deletes nothing on purpose.  A first draft classified nodes as
# unused and would have removed /dev/il1, which /etc/rc passes to
# dipconfig as its ARP channel (dipconfig.c:33).  Extras are listed for
# you to judge, not acted on.
